.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# GSD-derived phase/milestone state, regenerated on every GSD step. .planning/STATE.md
# is the committed authority; this file is a projection of it and of ROADMAP.md, and
# .planning/STATE.md itself names it as one of the two files "permitted to move" after
# an inventory capture. Committing a projection of a committed authority is the
# derivation cycle scripts/ci/verify_artifact_fixed_point.mjs exists to forbid.
.planning/state.json
